{"timestamp":"2026-08-26T05:52:45.395Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a03ca0-c953-7fc2-8b1f-53a0b6f542b4","call_id":"call_vityfeKAaCAZZfrmyfIxuwzY","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"scripts\nscripts/experiment\nscripts/serving\nscripts/serving/client\nscripts/setup\n\"\"\"Semantic E2E matrix for the four tiered-serving feature switches.\n\nThe valid runtime state space contains twelve answer-producing cells:\n\n* weight placement/representation has four states\n  (frozen/offloaded x uncompressed/compressed), and\n* KV placement/representation has three states\n  (HBM resident, raw offloaded, compressed offloaded).\n\n``KV offload=OFF, KV compression=ON`` is not a fourth KV state: the runtime\ncannot persist compressed KV without an offloadable tier.  Those four Boolean\nrows are unsupported and are kept visible as negative matrix entries.\n\nThe full matrix uses Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct because a BF16 70B model cannot fit\nthe true weight-offload-OFF cells in one 96 GiB GH200.  A 70B profile still\nexecutes the six supported weight-offload-ON cells using the placement-matched\n``flexgen`` pair.  The E2E is opt-in because every cell starts a fresh process:\n\n    TIERED_SERVE_RUN_FEATURE_MATRIX_E2E=1 \\\n      ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -s tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n\n    TIERED_SERVE_RUN_FEATURE_MATRIX_E2E=1 \\\n    TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\n      ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q -s tests/test_feature_matrix_e2e.py\n\nEach process reuses ``offline_offload_kvweight.py``'s semantic oracle, writes a\ngenerated-token dump, proves the requested route was active from runtime logs,\nand records whether its token IDs match the canonical raw baseline.  Set\n``TIERED_SERVE_FEATURE_MATRIX_REQUIRE_EXACT_TOKENS=1`` to promote that stronger\ndeterminism check to a test requirement.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nfrom dataclasses import asdict, dataclass\nimport hashlib\nimport itertools\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\nimport shlex\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\n\nimport pytest\nimport yaml\n\n\nREPO_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\nPYTHON = REPO_ROOT / \".venv\" / \"bin\" / \"python\"\nDRIVER = REPO_ROOT / \"offline_offload_kvweight.py\"\nPROMPT = REPO_ROOT / \"benchmarks\" / \"staged_correctness_prompt.txt\"\nMODEL_8B = \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\"\nMODEL_70B = \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\"\nDEFAULT_MODEL = MODEL_8B\nEXPECTED_TEXT = \"Paris\"\nCOMPONENTS = (\"qkv\", \"o\", \"gate_up\", \"down\")\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass FeatureCase:\n    weight_offload: bool\n    kv_offload: bool\n    weight_comp: bool\n    kv_comp: bool\n\n    @property\n    def case_id(self) -> str:\n        return (\n            f\"wo{int(self.weight_offload)}-ko{int(self.kv_offload)}-\"\n            f\"wc{int(self.weight_comp)}-kc{int(self.kv_comp)}\"\n        )\n\n    @property\n    def answer_supported(self) -> bool:\n        return self.kv_offload or not self.kv_comp\n\n    @property\n    def weight_mode(self) -> str:\n        if self.weight_offload:\n            return (\n                \"offload_compressed\"\n                if self.weight_comp else \"offload_uncompressed\"\n            )\n        return (\n            \"frozen_compressed\"\n            if self.weight_comp else \"frozen_uncompressed\"\n        )\n\n    @property\n    def weight_config(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Pure-placement config used by the full 8B matrix.\"\"\"\n        return {\n            (False, False): \"all-frozen-uncompressed\",\n            (False, True): \"all-frozen-compressed-p4\",\n            (True, False): \"all-streamed-uncompressed\",\n            (True, True): \"all-offload-compressed-p4\",\n        }[(self.weight_offload, self.weight_comp)]\n\n\nALL_CASES = tuple(\n    FeatureCase(*values)\n    for values in itertools.product((False, True), repeat=4)\n)\nANSWER_CASES = tuple(case for case in ALL_CASES if case.answer_supported)\nUNSUPPORTED_CASES = tuple(\n    case for case in ALL_CASES if not case.answer_supported)\n\n\ndef _model_name(model: str) -> str:\n    return model.rstrip(\"/\").split(\"/\")[-1]\n\n\ndef _answer_cases_for_model(model: str) -> tuple[FeatureCase, ...]:\n    model_name = _model_name(model)\n    if model_name == \"Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\":\n        return ANSWER_CASES\n    if model_name == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\":\n        return tuple(case for case in ANSWER_CASES if case.weight_offload)\n    raise ValueError(\n        \"feature matrix supports only Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct and \"\n        f\"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct; got {model!r}\")\n\n\ndef _weight_config(case: FeatureCase, model: str) -> str:\n    if _model_name(model) == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\":\n        if not case.weight_offload:\n            raise ValueError(\n                f\"{case.case_id}: 70B requires weight offloading\")\n        return \"flexgen-comp-p4\" if case.weight_comp else \"flexgen\"\n    return case.weight_config\n\n\ndef _expected_residency(\n    case: FeatureCase,\n    model: str,\n) -> dict[str, int]:\n    if _model_name(model) == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\":\n        return {\n            \"frozen_uncompressed\": 40,\n            case.weight_mode: 40,\n        }\n    return {case.weight_mode: 32}\n\n\ndef _canonical_baseline_id(model: str) -> str:\n    return (\n        \"wo1-ko0-wc0-kc0\"\n        if _model_name(model) == \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\"\n        else \"wo0-ko0-wc0-kc0\"\n    )\n\n\n_MATRIX_ENV_TO_CLEAR = (\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_ATS_DECOMP_FROZEN\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_ATS_DECOMP_OFFLOAD\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_GPU_RESERVE_GIB\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_ADDR_ORDER\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_SLACK\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_BLOB_STRIDE\",\n    \"TIERED_SERVE_KV_C